    <bpmn:process id="W_W4860" name="W4860. Audit-Ready Evidence, Regulator Data Requests &amp; Subpoena Response" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Regulator data request/return; subpoena/ordre; external audit; government audit (COA for B2G)
Frequency: Ad hoc
Volume: ~5–10 data requests/subpoenas per year
Owner: Compliance Portfolio Manager / Legal (VS-100.3) / Records (VS-88)
Participants: Domain owners, Internal Audit (VS-21), Privacy (VS-91), External counsel
Source: workflow W4860 — Audit-Ready Evidence, Regulator Data Requests &amp; Subpoena Response</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4860_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4860_Lane1" name="Legal">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4860_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
