      <bpmn:userTask id="W4860_Task6" name="Receive &amp; scope the data request/subpoena: regulator, scope, period…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Receive &amp; scope the data request/subpoena: regulator, scope, period, authorization (subpoena vs informal request), privacy implications (VS-91); assign the response owner and legal review
Responsible (R): Legal / Compliance Operations / Records
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per event (immediate)</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4860_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4860_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
