      <bpmn:userTask id="W4860_Task7" name="Produce the evidence: assemble from the repository (W4846) and records (VS-88)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Produce the evidence: assemble from the repository (W4846) and records (VS-88), apply legal-privilege/privacy review (VS-91), format per the request, and deliver within the deadline; manage any legal-hold (VS-88) on relevant records
Responsible (R): Records / Legal / Domain Owners / Privacy
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per event</bpmn:documentation>
