      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4860_Task8" name="Document the request/response in the audit trail (W4846) and legal matter…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Document the request/response in the audit trail (W4846) and legal matter (VS-100.3), manage any follow-up, and feed request-volume/themes to risk tiering (W4848) and analytics (W4862)
Responsible (R): Compliance Portfolio / Legal / Records
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4860_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4860_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
