      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Data-quality review; master-data change (VS-29); duplicate detection; analytics anomaly
Frequency: Continuous + periodic cleanup
Volume: All register records (~thousands)
Owner: Compliance Portfolio Manager / Master Data (VS-29)
Participants: Domain owners, Analytics (VS-28), Records (VS-88)
Source: workflow W4861 — License/Permit Data Governance, Master-Data Sync &amp; Duplicates Cleanup</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4861_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4861_Lane1" name="Compliance Operations">
