        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-730 (ensure controlled execution — Compliance Reporting, Analytics, Cost &amp; Program Assurance (PA-166.3).) | - CTL-730: register is single source of truth; data-quality KPIs enforced; duplicates/gaps resolved
Owner: Compliance Portfolio Manager / Master Data (VS-29)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
