      <bpmn:userTask id="W4862_Task4" name="Build the compliance-analytics suite: lapse/penalty trends by…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Build the compliance-analytics suite: lapse/penalty trends by site/domain/regulator, on-time-renewal trend, inspection-finding themes, provider performance (W4854), cost trend (W4859), regulatory-change volume (W4847), and obligation-coverage gaps (W4843)
Responsible (R): Analytics / Compliance Operations
Accountable (A): Compliance Portfolio Manager
