Responsible (R): Analytics / Compliance Portfolio / Strategy
Accountable (A): Compliance Portfolio Manager
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4862_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4862_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4862_Task6" name="Feed insights to strategy (W4864), risk tiering (W4848), governance (W4857)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Feed insights to strategy (W4864), risk tiering (W4848), governance (W4857), and continuous improvement (W4864/VS-133); track action closure
Responsible (R): Analytics / Compliance Portfolio
Accountable (A): Compliance Portfolio Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4862_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4862_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
