    <bpmn:process id="W_W4863" name="W4863. Internal Audit Coordination, Control Testing &amp; SOX/COSO-Style Assurance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual internal-audit plan (VS-21); SOX/COSO-style assurance cycle; regulator audit
Frequency: Annual + on regulator audit
Volume: 1 assurance program; ~2–4 audit cycles/year
Owner: Compliance Portfolio Manager / Internal Audit (VS-21)
Participants: Domain owners, Legal (VS-100.3), External auditors, Risk (VS-21.2)
Source: workflow W4863 — Internal Audit Coordination, Control Testing &amp; SOX/COSO-Style Assurance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4863_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4863_Lane1" name="Compliance Portfolio">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4863_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4863_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4863_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4863_Lane2" name="Internal Audit">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4863_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4863_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4863_Start4" name="Annual internal-audit plan (VS-21); SOX/COSO-style assurance cycle; regulator audit">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4863_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4863_Task5" name="Coordinate the compliance-portfolio audit plan with Internal Audit (VS-21)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Coordinate the compliance-portfolio audit plan with Internal Audit (VS-21): risk-based coverage of the register/calendar/ownership/renewal/evidence/provider/penalty controls; align with SOX/COSO-style assurance and the internal-controls matrix
Responsible (R): Compliance Portfolio / Internal Audit
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance / Head of Internal Audit
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4863_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4863_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4863_Task6" name="Support control testing: walkthroughs, sample testing of…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Support control testing: walkthroughs, sample testing of renewals/on-time/evidence/ABC (W4854), SOX-style key-control testing where compliance is a financial-reporting control (e.g., license-to-operate affecting revenue recognition), and remediation of findings
Responsible (R): Internal Audit / Compliance Portfolio / Domain Owners
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per audit cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4863_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4863_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4863_Task7" name="Track audit-finding remediation to closure, report to the audit &amp; risk…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Track audit-finding remediation to closure, report to the audit &amp; risk committee (VS-36), and feed findings to continuous improvement (W4864) and analytics (W4862)
Responsible (R): Compliance Portfolio / Internal Audit
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4863_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4863_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4863_End8" name="Complete">
