        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-730 (ensure controlled execution — Compliance Reporting, Analytics, Cost &amp; Program Assurance (PA-166.3).) | - CTL-730: risk-based audit coverage; SOX/COSO-style control testing; findings remediated &amp; reported
Owner: Compliance Portfolio Manager / Internal Audit (VS-21)</bpmn:text>
