      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4864_Start3" name="Annual program review; maturity assessment; major incident (W4853/W4858); strategy…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4864_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4864_Task4" name="Assess program maturity across dimensions (inventory completeness…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Assess program maturity across dimensions (inventory completeness, calendar/engine reliability, ownership/accountability, evidence/audit-trail, analytics, automation, governance) using a maturity model; benchmark vs industry/peer
Responsible (R): Compliance Portfolio / Strategy / Internal Audit
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4864_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4864_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4864_Task5" name="Optimize the operating model (W4841): central vs distributed balance, staffing…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Optimize the operating model (W4841): central vs distributed balance, staffing, make-vs-buy (providers W4854), automation opportunities (the in-house Audit &amp; GRC platform — BUILD, fit-gap H11, regulator-portal integration, AI-assisted monitoring), and cost/quality trade-offs
Responsible (R): Compliance Portfolio / Strategy / OpEx
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4864_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4864_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4864_Task6" name="Drive continuous improvement: prioritize initiatives, execute via OpEx (VS-133)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Drive continuous improvement: prioritize initiatives, execute via OpEx (VS-133) methodology, track benefit realization, and report program maturity &amp; improvement to the board (VS-36); capture emerging best-practice
Responsible (R): Compliance Portfolio / OpEx
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4864_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4864_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4864_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4864_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
