        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-730 (ensure controlled execution — Compliance Reporting, Analytics, Cost &amp; Program Assurance (PA-166.3).) | - CTL-730: maturity assessed annually; improvement pipeline managed; benefit realized &amp; reported
Owner: VP Legal &amp; Compliance / Chief Compliance Officer / Compliance Portfolio Manager</bpmn:text>
